Package: xhr-client
Version: 1.0.1
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ca-certificates
Maintainer: XHR contributors <noreply@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/jackh0006/XHR
Description: encrypted TCP-over-XHR SOCKS5 client
 XHR provides a loopback-only SOCKS5 listener that carries TCP connections
 through an Apps Script relay to an XHR exit. It has no telemetry and does not
 support UDP or QUIC.
